nment fees  when there's a problem for example if  one of our members has an accident in a  mine  we have to take them to the hospital  so it's very difficult to compete with  the illegal minds  meanwhile antonio govini is meeting one  of the 15 beekeepers supported by the  park and by the conservation group mars  bio  he is unsure about the mining work in  setsera  the use of mercury is a serious  violation of the rules  but the mining cooperative has at least  prevented hundreds of illegal ganperos  from coming to the park to look for gold  [Music]  still governing doesn't want another  cooperative here  he prefers to talk about the success of  sustainable agriculture which he hopes  can be expanded  with agricultural projects of which  beekeeping is just one example  we have been able to reduce the negative  impact humans have on the environment by  almost half  for one thing we currently see that  deforestation is decreasing  oh this florida is  these successes are solely needed the  mine blocking the elephant path where  the police burned down the camp  is fully operational again by the very  next day  the guy imperials will not stop looking  for gold because they are poor  and need the money  if they stop us from digging here all  the people will starve to death  by mining we can at least buy some food  and pay school fees  school fees i cannot stress that enough  the illegal prospectors will surely  continue searching for gold  it's more dangerous than working in a  cooperative but also more lucrative
 

